Subject: DocumentLoader.cpp: include EventLoop.h

It uses EventLoopTaskGroup::queueTask and got its definition from another file of its unified-source bundle; with WebAudio, WebRTC and the other features we leave out the bundles are cut differently and the build fails (member access into incomplete type).

diff --git a/Source/WebCore/loader/DocumentLoader.cpp b/Source/WebCore/loader/DocumentLoader.cpp
--- a/Source/WebCore/loader/DocumentLoader.cpp
+++ b/Source/WebCore/loader/DocumentLoader.cpp
@@ -53,6 +53,7 @@
 #include "DocumentWriter.h"
 #include "ElementChildIteratorInlines.h"
 #include "Event.h"
+#include "EventLoop.h"
 #include "EventNames.h"
 #include "ExtensionStyleSheets.h"
 #include "FormSubmission.h"
